# Two objects, a quad face and negative indices (P4-06 fixtures for readObj).
# Written for @extrudo/io's own tests; read into one body per object.
mtllib cube.mtl
o Base
v 0 0 0
v 10 0 0
v 10 10 0
v 0 10 0
v 0 0 5
v 10 0 5
v 10 10 5
v 0 10 5
vt 0 0
vn 0 0 1
# The bottom face as a quad (fanned into two triangles) with a uv and a normal.
f -4/1/1 -3/1/1 -2/1/1 -1/1/1
f 1//1 5//1 6//1 7//1
f 1//1 2//1 6//1 5//1
f 2//1 3//1 7//1 6//1
f 3//1 4//1 8//1 7//1
f 4//1 1//1 5//1 8//1
o Cover
v 0 0 10
v 10 0 10
v 5 8 14
f 9 10 11